      ],
      "content": "TRING RURAL            GRAND UNION CANAL - SP 9014                                         AYLESBURY ARM 9/129                                   Milepost on towpath -                                       near Wilstone at                                         Grid Ref SP 9024 1435 GV                                      II Milepost giving distance along Aylesbury Arm. 1896 for Grand Junction Canal Company.  In raised  lettering  on back  'LONDON  & LANKASHIRE/  ELECTRICAL & GENL/ENGINEERING CO LIMITED/LONDON'. Cast iron painted. A small rectangular upright plate with radiused corners and raised bead at edge.  Figure  '1'  in relief in centre. Plate cast integral with T-section iron post with makers' name once on each half of back. Stone mileposts  were  replaced  by  cast  iron  ones  in  1896  (Branch Johnson(1970)120). Listing NGR: SP9024514350"
    }
  ],
